coax.pio comes from hanshuebner/coax-tcp, interface3 branch, file
interface3/firmware/coax.pio at commit 78a0040b4f42a689128f8b34371459e5c430cee1.
firmware/core/manchester.c (coax_manchester_encode, from
interface3/firmware/coax.c) and firmware/src/coax_term.pio (recv_tap, with
one instruction changed) come from the same commit, as do the state machine
and DMA settings that firmware/src/coax_link.c follows (coax.c and tap.c).
